sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set-for tokyo limit.daily 2
set-for tokyo limit.daily_kib 1
send f1 alice tokyo one
send f2 bob tokyo two
advance 10s
forecast tokyo 10
forecast tokyo 2000
at d0 14:59:59
forecast tokyo 10
at d0 15:00:00
forecast tokyo 10
stats tokyo
